{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:16 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"姜濤養狗後作息變規律  演唱會臨近打波唔錫身\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/21fe2986bcc3e61588fc9dc5c7a71352/2026-11/page_H.jpg\"/>\n<p>MIRROR 12子（1日）舉行新專輯《12》簽名會，近千鏡粉到場。活動上，Jer玩輸遊戲，被推薦舉起姜濤，他笑言無問題，平日有舉重，「我無意思指他重，我只是有鍛練。」姜濤即指可以再來一次，想像已覺得high。</p>\n<h2>姜濤備戰903籃球賽︰唔使加操</h2>\n<p>姜濤早前養狗成為奶爸。問何時讓狗狗曝光？他表示無特別，如社交平台所講，他有去放狗，令生活變規律，有寵物就要定時照顧。另外，早前找數請小學生食快餐，問下次可敢應承小朋友？他表示小朋友開心就可以，笑說食快餐自己也能負擔。問備戰903籃球賽情況？他指平日都有打波，不用加操。演唱會臨近，打波小心點？他指如常表現。至於MIRROR演唱會的準備方面，Lokman指現在小組式排練，隊員都表示順利，之後再全團一起排練。Lokman則仍在拍戲，稍後歸隊練舞。</p>\n<img alt=\"Jer玩輸遊戲，要舉起姜濤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d0708caff5fdddb2f5465a08aec9a51/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jer︰「冇問題！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40a9bc1dfae3ad032d2ac8b558a6ec31/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jer狀甚吃力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad6444c1f8443e834e8279e3a9bbcb07/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"keep住！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5884e78e2ad3ef0de417e1556b301654/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"畀啲掙扎！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/766f1912c00912f3660e60f3b020c6e5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_28_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好玩得！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc71078497643252f9c52a6c212ce449/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"至於MIRROR演唱會的準備方面，Lokman指現在小組式排練。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6a7f98f2adcda283f94ea5daec75b84/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_15_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.363619+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:16:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:04.160133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:04.160133+00:00","content_hash":"328a70cea4a637d9a9db1f0960dbc1bb17533db0a6c7075fcb31b6193b406214","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}